        "0.50": "Arjuna said: Seeing this gentle human form of yours, Janārdana, I am now composed; my mind is restored to its natural state.",
        "0.51": "The Blessed Lord said: This form of mine that you have seen is very hard to see; even the gods ever long for a sight of it.",
        "0.52": "Not by the Vedas, nor by austerity, nor by charity, nor by sacrifice can I be seen as you have seen me.",
